<title>NEW ZEALAND: Dairy Brands year profit falls sharply.</title>
<headline>Dairy Brands year profit falls sharply.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to Sept 30.</p>
<p>			   (million NZ$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			   0.249 vs 3.015</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			   0.51 vs 6.19</p>
<p>    Turnover				12.8 vs 16.8</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 0.21 vs 3.00</p>
<p>    Tax					nil vs same</p>
<p>    Shares outstanding (million)   48.74 vs n/a</p>
<p>Note - Dairy Brands New Zealand Ltd is a dairy farming and milk-based products processing company.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
